        "<strong>Bubble 开销分析</strong>：空闲时间比例为 <span class=\"kb-math kb-math-inline\">O((K-1)/(M+K-1))</span>，当 <span class=\"kb-math kb-math-inline\">M \\geq 4K</span> 时可忽略不计",
